sequenceDiagram
    participant Maintainer as Maintainer
    participant Skill as systemic-capability-wiring
    participant CLI as ai-surface-budget/learning-loop-review/systemic-impact/control-plane-review/spec-pack/spec-cascade
    participant Reports as Review reports
    participant Decision as Human decision

    Maintainer->>Skill: Identify affected surfaces
    Skill->>CLI: Recommend systemic-impact and control-plane review
    alt Prompts, agents, skills, instructions, workflows, manuals, or governance docs changed
        Skill->>CLI: Recommend ai-surface-budget
    end
    alt Lesson may affect future behavior or governed artifacts
        Skill->>CLI: Recommend learning-loop-review
    end
    alt Specs, tasks, source refs, or source traceability changed
        Skill->>CLI: Recommend spec-pack, spec-cascade, and module-header checks
    end
    CLI->>Reports: Record affected families, traceability findings, next actions
    Reports->>Decision: Present gaps, waivers, remediation options
    Decision->>Decision: Update artifacts or record known residual risk
